' S-610 (2026-10-17): a BYREF parameter of a STATIC method. Native x64 passed the VALUE where the callee expected an address and crashed with an
' access violation (exit 0xC0000005, no output). WASM and legacy AST-x64 reject BYREF parameters with an explicit message (G-WASM-12, S-167-L).
CLASS Say
    PUBLIC
    STATIC METHOD Artir(BYREF n AS I32)
        n = n + 1
    END METHOD
END CLASS
DIM k AS I32
k = 5
Say.Artir(k)
PRINT k
